      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIVID DREAM NZ (2) scored a comfortable win when fresh from a layoff last start over 2080m at Cranbourne on July 19, finishing 9 metres ahead of his rivals. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Tackles a similar assignment and he can salute once again. BAYSTYLE (5) finished fifth at Ballarat two runs back then performed impressively last start, making up plenty of ground but being denied by a narrow margin over 1720m at this track. Meets a comparable field and he can figure in the finish. SHIFFRIN (7) finished third at this track last time. Consistent performer whose best form stacks up favourably so she must be included. HAPPENSTBABEACHBOY (4) found form and finished in the money two runs ago then came back to earth when he broke and 99th last start over 1710m at Ballarat, coming home from the winner. Must get things right but if he does a big run is on the cards.",
